<title>USA: Altera says judge confirms jury verdict.</title>
<headline>Altera says judge confirms jury verdict.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Altera Corp said Monday a U.S. District Court judge has issued a ruling in Altera's favor in its litigation with Advanced Micro Devices Inc.</p>
<p>In June, a jury found cross-licensing pact between it and Advanced Micro to be valid, but Advanced Micro had asked the court to overturn the verdict.  The judge's ruling confirmed the jury's verdict, according to Altera.</p>
<p>The suit was originally filed in August 1994 by Advanced Micro.</p>
